9. Issues encountered and resolved

Validation contained no fraud — traced to too few independent fraud groups; collected new scenarios.
V2 learned a device-novelty shortcut — exposed by challenge data; blocked promotion and improved collection.
Active integration missing from main.py — independent unit tests passed, but image test caught the missing application patch; applied and retested.
Private release unreadable inside capability-dropped container — diagnosed UID mismatch; ran offline tests as host UID/GID instead of weakening permissions.
Overly broad shell permissions — identified chmod 777 as unnecessary and supplied owner-only permissions.
Normal synthetic bursts triggered RULE_CARD_TESTING — recorded as an unresolved rule-level false positive; did not change truth labels to hide it.